The XML files in this directory are copied, unchanged, from chroma v2.27.0's
lexers/embedded/ directory (github.com/alecthomas/chroma/v2, MIT licensed).
../lexers.go embeds them and parses them lazily, on first use.

They are kept BYTE-FOR-BYTE identical to the dependency's copies, so that
re-copying one after a dependency upgrade is a diff with no local edits to
reconcile, and so nothing here is a second, drifting copy of a table somebody
else maintains. Do not edit them here: a definition that needs a change needs it
in the dependency, or a rule of our own in ../lexers_builtin.go.

